join durai center
join cordelle right
durai: HEY EVERYBODY! LET'S GO INSIDE AND BUY MY BREAD!
durai: ...
cordelle: Durai? I think there's a homeless guy outside... dancing. And shouting.
join customer left
customer: Hi, just these.
cordelle: Oh, um... The label says... £1.50, so... £1.50 please.
customer: Hey, I love the bread guy. Can I have this bread?
cordelle: Bread guy...? Um, sure!
leave customer
cordelle: ...
durai: You the new girl?
cordelle: Yeah! You... work here?
durai: Do you think I wear this for fun?
durai: The name's Durai. And when I'm in that suit, I'm not having fun. I'm putting my soul on the line to make a good show for those people.
cordelle: Well you seem to enjoy it, ha...
durai: Do you know how to stock shelves?
cordelle: Kind of..? Are you going to train me?
durai: I'll train through observation. I can't stock in this costume.
cordelle: Can't you take it off?
durai: Not without cost. Don't you see how much the customers love me? Sales would plummet. Dramatically.
cordelle: So I'll never see you out of, um... the Breadsworth costume?
durai: Not willingly. Unless you see me on TV, but we won't know each other then.
cordelle: Big dreams?
durai: Realistic dreams. I'm destined to be famous, just waiting for my big break.
cordelle: Out of everyone here, you think you're the most likely to get famous? Go viral for selling bread?
durai: I mean... have you met Roy or Oleysa? Or yourself? It's not exactly tough competition. I'm star material.
cordelle: And I'm not?
durai: Well, I haven't seen you stock those shelves yet.
[wait time="1.0"]
durai: Not bad, not bad. Not exactly good, but not bad.
cordelle: I mean, I think I did a pretty good job! I'm proud of myself.
durai: Sweet. No one else will be.
cordelle: That's not a very positive mindset... Not very star material.
durai: Stars know that they're above everyone else. That's why they're up in the sky.
cordelle: I think they're up there to guide everyone else, shine their light, etcetera. I'm a glass half-full kind of girl.
durai: Suit yourself.
durai: ...
durai: WAHEY! LET'S BUY BREAD! THERE'S PLENTY BREAD INSIDE!
Durai usually helps sales. Good shift.
[signal arg="shift_good"]